  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Anti-Corruption programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Prosperity Fund&#x2019;s Global Anti-Corruption Programme includes 9 projects delivered bilaterally, regionally and globally until March 2022.

The programme supports activity at regional and global levels and operates in 5 Prosperity Fund priority countries:
- Colombia
- Indonesia
- Malaysia
- Mexico
- South Africa</narrative>
  </description>
